      "revision": 1306378392,
      "text": "Crotalaria incana is a species of flowering plant in the Fabaceae family known by various names including shake-shake, velvety rattlebox, silver rattlepod, and woolly rattlepod."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Crotalaria incana",
